	<key>readme</key>
	<string>## Claude Code Launcher

Launch VS Code or Claude Code in your project directories.

### Keywords
- `vs` - Open project in VS Code
- `cc` - Open project in Claude Code (Terminal)
- `gh` - Open project on GitHub
- `review &lt;pr-url&gt; [prompt]` - Check out the PR branch in `~/src/github.com/&lt;owner&gt;/&lt;repo&gt;` and launch Claude Code with the optional prompt

### Configuration
Set the `project_dirs` workflow variable to a colon-separated list of directories:

Example: `~/src/github.com/fredsmith:~/claude-working`

### Modifiers
- `Cmd+Enter` - Reveal project in Finder</string>
